

### 特定の科目の詳細データを取得
### 基礎数学 = %E5%9F%BA%E7%A4%8E%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6
GET http://localhost:8000/grade/detail/基礎数学入門
Accept: application/json


### カテゴリーを取得
GET http://localhost:8000/grade/categories
Accept: application/json

### 履修者推移取得
GET http://localhost:8000/enrollment/%E5%9F%BA%E7%A4%8E%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80
Accept: application/json